Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL PATCH] gambit: harden opt-in static reuse

Apply after 0019. Reject incomplete digests and changed tool/source
snapshots; reject non-regular proof targets; retain the original
compiler path for calls with diagnostics or auxiliary outputs.
This candidate remains default-off pending second-consumer admission.

diff --git a/bin/gambit-static-object-reuse.unix b/bin/gambit-static-object-reuse.unix
